	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swchampion_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アイリス『やっほー！▼
ひさしぶり　だね！
ヒウンシティ　いらい　だもんね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:31:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:18:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アイリス『やっほー！▼
ひさしぶり　だね！
ヒウンシティ　以来　だもんね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:36:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:21:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・posイベント
　GIRDX＝、GRIDZ＝
・続けてswchampion_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:30:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:18:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swchampion_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひょっとして　あたしの
おじーちゃんに　ちょうせん？▼
うん！　ソウリュウシティの
ジムリーダー　シャガは▽
あたしの　おじーちゃん　なの！▼
といっても
ちの　つながりは　ないんだけどね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:21:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ひょっとして　あたしの
おじーちゃんに　挑戦？▼
うん！　ソウリュウシティの
ジムリーダー　シャガは▽
あたしの　おじーちゃん　なの！▼
といっても
血の　つながりは　ないんだけどね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:36:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:21:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けてswchampion_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:35:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:24:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swchampion_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あっ！　ジムは　あっち！▼
ちょうせん　するまえに
９ばんどうろに　いくのも　いいかも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:36:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:21:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あっ！　ジムは　あっち！▼
挑戦する　前に
９番道路に　行くのも　いいかも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:36:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:21:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・画面左を向いて
・続けて
　主人公♂→swchampion_04
　主人公♀→swchampion_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:39:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:24:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swchampion_04">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それにしても　おにーちゃん　って
ポケモンに　したわれて　いるのね！▼
ボールの　なかからでも
うれしそうな　きもち　つたわってくる！▼
じゃ　がんばってねー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:39:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:34:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それにしても　おにーちゃん　って
ポケモンに　慕われて　いるのね！▼
ボールの　中からでも
うれしそうな　気持ち　伝わってくる！▼
じゃ　がんばってねー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:39:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:34:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・主人公＝♂
・再度、主人公と向き合って
・メッセージ表示後、r11方面へ移動
・画面外に消えると主人公操作可能に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:38:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:34:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
