	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『おまえは
Ｎのしろ　で……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:24:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:47:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『おまえは
Ｎの城　で……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:40:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:47:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてsage7_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:45:51" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER7
ジムリーダー・シャガ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T11:22:48" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_sage7_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヴィオ『それにしても　さむい▼
ワタシは　ふるえている
くるしいが　いきておる▼
それこそが　いきている　じっかん！
ワタシという　そんざいの　しょうめい！▼
さて　これらは　プラズマだんの
ぎじゅつで　うみだした▽
とくしゅな　こおり！▽
かきごおりには　できませぬ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:45:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:54:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヴィオ『それにしても　寒い▼
ワタシは　震えている
苦しいが　生きておる▼
それこそが　生命の　実感！
ワタシという　存在の　証明！▼
さて　これらは　プラズマ団の
技術で　うみだした　特殊な　氷！▽
かき氷には　できませぬ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:42:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:56:38" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・シャガに近づき、所定の位置へ
　このときプラズマ団したっぱを引き連れている
　画面下を向いてメッセージ表示
・続けてsage7_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:45:46" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:54:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_sage7_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ようけんを　つたえよう！　シャガどの
いでんしのくさび　とやらを　ください▼
この　ソウリュウは
かこと　みらいが　からみあう　まち▼
わかれた　ポケモンを　つなげる
くさびが　あるに　ふさわしい　ばしょだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T07:04:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:57:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>用件を　伝えよう！　シャガ殿
いでんしのくさび　とやらを　ください▼
この　ソウリュウは
過去と　未来が　絡みあう　街▼
分かれた　ポケモンを　つなげる
くさびが　あるに　ふさわしい　場所だ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T07:04:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:57:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・一歩前進
・続けてswleader7_09</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:46:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:57:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『２ねんまえの　おまえたちの
しょぎょうを　しっている　にんげんが
すなおに　わたすと　かんがえるのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:46:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:58:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『２年前の　おまえたちの
所業を　知っている　人間が
素直に　渡すと　考えるのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:46:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:58:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてsage7_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:46:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER7
ジムリーダー・シャガ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T11:22:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_sage7_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヴィオ『そうぞうどおりの　おこたえ▼
ほんらいで　あれば　もういちど
こおりを　うちこむと　おどしたいが▽
しばらくは　つかえぬし……▼
さむい　なか　めんどう　ですが
さがすしか　ないのか……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:45:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:59:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヴィオ『想像通りの　お答え▼
本来であれば　もう一度
氷を　撃ちこむと　脅したいが▽
しばらくは　使えぬし……▼
寒い中　面倒ですが
探すしか　ないのか……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:43:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:59:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ後、七賢人、画面下に移動
　あわせてプラズマ団したっぱも移動する
　（七賢人はイベントまで消しておく）
・続けてswleader7_10
</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:51:21" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:59:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『この　こおりを　とかすには
あいつらを　かたづけるしか　ない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:47:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T04:01:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『氷漬けを　打破するには
あいつらを　かたづけるしか　ない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T02:47:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
