	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_15"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふむ……！　いって　もどるまでの
きろくこうしん　だな▼
いいか　[Name:TrainerName ]
いでんしのくさび　とは　これだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:02:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:50:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ふむ……！　行って　戻るまでの
記録更新　だな▼
いいか　[Name:TrainerName ]
いでんしのくさび　とは　これだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:02:52" />
