				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_16"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これが　あいつら……
プラズマだんの　てに　わたらなくて▽
ほんとうに　よかった！▼
もくてきは　わからぬが　まちがいなく
よからぬことを　たくらんでいるだろう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:04:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:50:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これが　あいつら……
プラズマ団の　手に　渡らなくて▽
本当に　よかった！▼
目的は　わからぬが　間違いなく
よからぬことを　企んでいるだろう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:04:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:50:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてninja_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:23:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER7
ジムリーダー・シャガ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T11:22:56" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_ninja_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『……ジムが　かくしばしょか
なるほど　よく　かんがえている▼
シャガが　いなければ　はいれないし
いれば　さいきょうの　ばんにんとなる▼
ポケモンジムを　かいそう　したのも
それが　りゆう　か▼
ですが　いでんしのくさび　は
いま　わたしが　いただきましたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:52:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:51:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『……ジムが　隠し場所か
なるほど　よく　考えている▼
シャガが　いなければ　入れないし
いれば　最強の　番人となる▼
ポケモンジムを　改装したのも
それが　理由か▼
ですが　いでんしのくさび　は
今　わたしが　いただきましたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:05:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:52:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・突然出現する
・シャガ、主人公に！マーク後
　メッセージ表示
・続けてswleader7_17</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:53:54" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NINJA
ダークトリニティ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:51:48" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_17"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『まさか　しちけんじん　すら
りようして　くさびの　ありかを▽
さぐる　つもり　だったとはな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:53:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:53:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『まさか　七賢人すら
利用して　くさびの　在り処を▽
探る　つもり　だったとはな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:06:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T05:53:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてninja_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:53:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER7
ジムリーダー・シャガ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T11:22:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_ninja_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『ええ　おっしゃるとおり▼
ですが　どんな　てを　つかってでも
こんかいは　もくてきを　たっせいします▼
２ねんは　ぞんがい　ながいものです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:12:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:23:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『ええ　おっしゃるとおり▼
ですが　どんな　手段ででも
今回は　目的を　達成します▼
２年は　存外　長いものです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:12:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:23:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後、１体から３体へ
　画面下に移動
　１体のみ
・続けてswleader7_18</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:53:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NINJA
ダークトリニティ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:22:52" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_18"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『うばわれたら
うばいかえすだけだ　いくぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:30:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:24:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『奪われたら
奪い返すだけだ　行くぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:12:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:24:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・移動、画面外に消えたら主人公操作可能</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:30:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER7
ジムリーダー・シャガ</Text>
