	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_swleader7_19"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『この　あたりには　おらぬようだ
だが　あいつらは　けはいを　けすからな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『この辺りには　おらぬようだ
だが　あいつらは　気配を　消すからな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:12:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T06:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・氷のないところでキョロキョロ＋ウロウロ
・ダークトリニティとの戦闘後まで繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T10:30:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
