	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_gentleman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なぜ　ポケモンは
われわれの　そばに　いてくれるのか？▼
ポケモンと　はなせたら　わかるけど
きくのは　なんだか　こわいね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T04:32:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なぜ　ポケモンは
われわれの　隣に　いてくれるのか？▼
ポケモンと　話せたら　わかるけど
きくのは　なんだか　怖いね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T04:32:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア前
※swanでメッセージ変更</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T04:30:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
