		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_gentleman_01w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　まちには　いきてきた
ひと　すべての　おもいが▼
かたちを　かえずに
つみかさなって　いるんだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この街には　生きてきた
人全ての　思いが▼
形を　変えずに
積み重なって　いるんだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後＋WHITEver</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T04:03:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08_gentleman_01b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　まちは　たえず　かわっていく▼
そして　かわるたびに　そのとき
いきている　ひとたちの　おもいを▽
きざみこめば　いいんだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この街は　絶えず　変わっていく▼
そして　変わるたびに　そのとき
生きている　人たちの　思いを▽
刻みこめば　いいんだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後＋BLACKver</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T04:03:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
