				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T03:59:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN３</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
